{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1174.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e96afe52527e68ef4a3bf7f3267c897b32b659505231550e76de47980b21e27f","ja":"遠出が無理なら","zh":"如果没法去远处的话","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1174.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e15ad9232709740a8723a1d2ed158c72db6f378f3b61e52eb477963c4ddd493e","ja":"●●●●プロデューサー、無理したら、\n遠出する時間作れるかもって言ってたけど。","zh":"●●●●制作人之前虽然说过，要是拼一把的话，\n或许还能挤出出远门的时间。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1174.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"02a0b5217a2beb08b6d0c78a6def3f6a28a12d8c4fe2d000df9c5b920924eb9f","ja":"それだと本末転倒だよね……。\nお花見でリフレッシュしてもらいたいのに！","zh":"那样的话就本末倒置了呢……。\n明明是想让大家在赏花时好好放松一下的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1174.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"eabbd079cd25a1da79cdf56ebc2fa59e5e6422910e0888b08c3fc020310e6739","ja":"となると……お花見ではなく、別の形で\n打ち上げをした方がいいでしょうか？","zh":"这样的话……是不是不要办赏花会，\n而是换成别的方式来办庆功宴比较好呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1174.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"048583514a09150caf5c028b12395c1b82d9b27b58e841297de864e1729e98dd","ja":"そうだね、今回は残念だけど……。","zh":"是啊，虽然这次很遗憾……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1174.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"1f49f51f76b8b20ecd47d6eb429a4ae91e6086354485089698a96ef31607b3de","ja":"あ～あ、劇場の近くに、\n桜が満開な場所でもあったらな～！","zh":"唉～要是剧场附近，\n有樱花盛开的地方就好了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1174.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"e421282425abdb67b8e21e1b36c3814e7ed2d83084ae76e62729e40f74a0bbee","ja":"本当にね……あっ！　そういえば、あそこに……。","zh":"真的呢……啊！说起来，那边……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1174.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"2a2c1285c241045f6004914b759a2cca0938d15f48452571adb20b487940c0ec","ja":"あのさ！　劇場の表からちょっと行ったところに、\nたしか桜、咲いてたよね！？","zh":"那个！从剧场正门稍微走一段的地方，\n樱花好像开了对吧！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1174.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"89d8d71a5329de0c156962af5c226d57dad80b70f65ed0ea6856a65efe49d0d0","ja":"う、うん。\nでもあそこって、1本だけじゃなかったっけ？","zh":"唔、嗯。\n不过那里不是只有1个吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1174.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"83815d156989a6582a152e8425459aab1f27e0e437d2200ae6750b198687c2ae","ja":"1本だけでも十分だよ！\n桜が少なくても、みんなが集まれば！","zh":"光有1棵树也足够了！\n樱花就算不多，只要大家聚在一起就好！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1174.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"1a7efb8fbe05f933046adb107afd8efdf19c4d4ee5e8d8a5d26ea50c81ded14c","ja":"そっか！　オレたちで、\n●●●●プロデューサーを楽しませればいいんだ！","zh":"原来如此！　让我们来让●●●●制作人开心起来吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1174.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"1895167b111aca015c75eb2c2ec98218fab9bfbab39182eed3f2d7f37410c90f","ja":"それなら遠出もしなくていいし、\nゆっくりする時間も作れそうだね♪","zh":"那样的话就不用出远门了，\n也能腾出时间好好放松一下呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1174.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"6a2e04b077ab286dc851ee8615e3676c016e5b7fc473cbfe7e490c30bd507c69","ja":"はい！　私、もう一度●●●●プロデューサーに\n確認してきますね♪","zh":"好！我再去跟●●●●制作人\n确认一下♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
